{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"structural_monotony\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"The flag is plausible because several pattern sections repeat the same announce-the-pattern then endorse/explain arc, but the annotator supplied no supporting evidence for a whole-document judgment.\",\"evidence\":[\"With pattern 2, **“Systematically distribute care labour”**,\",\"Pattern 3 introduced the idea that groups should **“Make explicit norms and boundaries”**\",\"Pattern 7 proposed **“Using rhythm to cut information overload”**\"]},{\"id\":\"tonal_uniformity\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"A consistent enthusiastic practitioner register is a plausible reading, but the annotator gave no evidence from multiple parts of the document to support the whole-text claim.\",\"evidence\":[\"Their pragmatic inspiration shone through the event, like a beam of brilliance from above.\",\"Brilliant advice which might be hard for some egos to hear.\",\"I highly recommend their [future workshops](http://www.richdecibels.com/workshops/) to others, which I am sure will help inspire anyone that attends.\"]},{\"id\":\"faux_specificity\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"The clear judgment is plausible because the piece uses concrete event details rather than generic pseudo-specific filler, but the annotator provided no evidence to establish that absence.\",\"evidence\":[\"The event took place at the always inspiring [Newspeak House](https://twitter.com/nwspk), with roughly 30 participants split into groups.\",\"4 slides and 20 minutes later I was reeling with new ideas.\",\"it was gone 11am and I had only had one tiny cup of tea…\"]},{\"id\":\"neutrality_collapse\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"The document clearly takes a position, but the annotator did not support that whole-document judgment with evidence.\",\"evidence\":[\"Make no mistake\",\"The more effective we can make decentralised teams the more positive change we will be able to deliver.\",\"I highly recommend their [future workshops](http://www.richdecibels.com/workshops/) to others\"]},{\"id\":\"even_jargon_distribution\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"It is plausible that the technical vocabulary clusters around the organisational-method sections, but the annotator offered no evidence for that distributional claim.\",\"evidence\":[\"horizontal management\",\"**“Systematically distribute care labour”**\",\"the ‘holy trinity’ for group management: A tool for realtime communication\"]},{\"id\":\"forced_synesthesia\",\"verdict\":\"misclassified\",\"rationale\":\"The cited phrase is an embodied metaphor about knowledge transfer, not a cross-modal sensory mapping of the kind this registry item targets.\",\"evidence\":[\"I could almost feel his hard-earned acumen making its way from his brain into my own.\"]},{\"id\":\"generic_metaphors\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"Both cited phrases are stock figurative shortcuts rather than concrete, situation-specific metaphors, so the annotator's flag and examples fit the category.\",\"evidence\":[\"like a beam of brilliance from above\",\"the elephant which lurks in every room\"]},{\"id\":\"referential_clarity\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"A clear judgment is plausible because most pronouns and definite descriptions are recoverable in context, but the annotator gave no evidence for that assessment.\",\"evidence\":[\"We came back to this theme in the second session (see below)\",\"The real gem is to set the right length and kind of rhythms\",\"This is exactly what [Loomio](https://www.loomio.org/) was built for.\"]},{\"id\":\"formulaic_parallelism\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"The cited sentence relies on neatly balanced oppositions that sound conclusive without adding much mechanism, which matches the registry definition.\",\"evidence\":[\"which can be more inclusive and less invasive; timely but not hurried.\"]},{\"id\":\"semantic_redundancy\",\"verdict\":\"overcall\",\"rationale\":\"The closing sentence is a broader concluding synthesis about decentralised teams and social impact, not a merely redundant restatement of a nearby claim.\",\"evidence\":[\"The more effective we can make decentralised teams the more positive change we will be able to deliver.\",\"Simple, effective relationship building which is bound to reduce conflicts.\",\"your team is bound to be more effective.\"]},{\"id\":\"underspecified_language\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"The flagged phrases are evaluative or abstract in ways that leave their criterion unstated, and the annotator's explanations match that problem.\",\"evidence\":[\"well planned and designed workshop\",\"such timely content\",\"There is enormous strength in continuous participatory change.\",\"Brilliant advice which might be hard for some egos to hear.\"]},{\"id\":\"context_leakage\",\"verdict\":\"overcall\",\"rationale\":\"\\\"Make no mistake\\\" functions here as ordinary emphatic setup, not as a reply to a missing conversational objection that the reader must know.\",\"evidence\":[\"Make no mistake [Rich](http://richdecibels.com/) and [Nati](https://twitter.com/lombardonati?lang=en), who delivered this workshop as part of their [grand tour](https://www.eventbrite.co.nz/o/rich-and-nati-from-loomio-and-enspiral-13653532354), have been living and breathing this stuff for years.\"]},{\"id\":\"performed_candour\",\"verdict\":\"insufficient_evidence\",\"rationale\":\"The clear judgment is plausible because the prose does not lean on obvious sincerity boosters, but the annotator supplied no evidence for that absence.\",\"evidence\":[\"It sounds simple, but ignoring this step can be perilous.\",\"Refreshingly, Rich recognises that power imbalances are inevitable,\",\"I highly recommend their [future workshops](http://www.richdecibels.com/workshops/) to others\"]},{\"id\":\"vacuous_connection\",\"verdict\":\"supported\",\"rationale\":\"Both cited sentences assert effectiveness through causal linkage without stating the mechanism in the sentence itself, so the annotator's flag is justified.\",\"evidence\":[\"Simple, effective relationship building which is bound to reduce conflicts.\",\"If you can clearly define and agree which tool/s you will be using for each of these three essential areas of group work, your team is bound to be more effective.\"]},{\"id\":\"genre_specific\",\"verdict\":\"misclassified\",\"rationale\":\"The piece is better classified as journalism or event reportage than as default, since it reports a specific workshop, names participants, place, and activities, then adds evaluation.\",\"evidence\":[\"It summarises a workshop from the founders of Loomio, at which they shared their distilled wisdom for effective collaboration within groups.\",\"The event took place at the always inspiring [Newspeak House](https://twitter.com/nwspk), with roughly 30 participants split into groups.\",\"For the rest of the workshop they split us out into groups in which we defined a challenge we were facing\"]}]}"}}
